      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INGA JOKER (2) pinged the lids from out wide but run ended and faded out of it late when 5th at this track in Bottom Up - Grade 5 company. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Can bounce back. STREET SIXTY SIX (4) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Little Narla (22.61) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Must be included in calculations. ARGYLE EMMA (1) is drawn well on the inside. Last start finished 4th in a Grade 5 on July 29 over 390m at Ballarat behind Eleventh Scotch beaten 6 lengths (22.85). Can feature with the right run. IMPRESS JOE (3) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
